{
  "markdown": "### Render Markdown in Rust\n\nFerromark turns **Markdown** into HTML:\n\n```rust\nlet html = ferromark::to_html(\"Hello, **world**!\").unwrap();\nassert_eq!(html, \"<p>Hello, <strong>world</strong>!</p>\\n\");\n```\n",
  "html": "<h3 id=\"render-markdown-in-rust\">Render Markdown in Rust</h3>\n<p>Ferromark turns <strong>Markdown</strong> into HTML:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki gruvbox-dark-hard\" style=\"background-color:#1d2021;color:#ebdbb2\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FE8019\">let</span><span style=\"color:#83A598\"> html</span><span style=\"color:#8EC07C\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#FABD2F\"> ferromark</span><span style=\"color:#8EC07C\">::</span><span style=\"color:#FABD2F\">to_html</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#B8BB26\">Hello, **world**!</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">)</span><span style=\"color:#8EC07C\">.</span><span style=\"color:#FABD2F\">unwrap</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FABD2F\">assert_eq!</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">(</span><span style=\"color:#83A598\">html</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">,</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#B8BB26\">&#x3C;p>Hello, &#x3C;strong>world&#x3C;/strong>!&#x3C;/p></span><span style=\"color:#D3869B\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#A89984\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>",
  "theme": "gruvbox-dark-hard",
